  "details": "1. Launch in VR.\n\n2. Enable Responsive Menu.\n\n3. Tilt your head ~15-90deg.\n\n4. Open the chat box.\n\n5. Snap the keyboard to the input field.\n\n6. Move the input field around.\n\n7. Notice the odd snap pivoting behavior, especially while tiling your head while moving the input field.\n\nThe keyboard when attached to an input field pivots oddly with the input field with the Responsive Menu setting + tilting your head.",
